# NAME TAG: the releases of the owner's repositories (github.com/adyoull)
# this port is built with. riscos-crossdev's line also picks the container
# image for GitHub's builds; .github/workflows/riscos-deps-update.yml opens
# a pull request when one of these has a newer release (riscos-crossdev
# docs/CI.md). ci/riscos-deps-hook.sh updates the other files that follow
# them: the SDL overlay copy (riscos-mesa) and build/SOURCES (riscos-softmidi).
riscos-crossdev v1.8.2
riscos-mesa v20.3.5-17
riscos-softmidi v0.5.0
